# Terms the pre-commit hook refuses to let into this public repo.
# One extended-regex pattern per line; '#' comments and blank lines ignored.
#
# setup.sh copies this file to .githooks/blocked-terms, which is untracked —
# the names themselves (private repos, internal hosts, project codenames) are
# exactly what should not be committed here. Uncomment and edit locally.
#
# my-private-repo
# internal\.example\.com
